<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.1"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:bur="clr-namespace:Buridan.Bonsai;assembly=Buridan.Bonsai"
                 xmlns:cv="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Vision;assembly=Bonsai.Vision"
                 xmlns:gui="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Gui;assembly=Bonsai.Gui"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>Control system for the Buridan arena: LED ring protocols on the Raspberry Pi, camera feed, thresholding, tracking and recording. See the README note inside the workflow.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>README: Buridan arena control</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[# Buridan arena control

**How to use**
1. Start the workflow (F5).
2. Open the window by double-clicking the **MainWindow** node (bottom right) while the workflow runs. Bonsai remembers it for the next time.
3. In the settings grid (left), check *3. Pi connection* (host, user name, password) and choose the *Data folder* in *1. Experiment*.
4. Pick a protocol in the drop-down list and press **Start experiment**. Recording starts, and the protocol plays on the LED ring.
5. Recording stops when the protocol ends, or when you press **Stop experiment**.

**Creating a protocol**
Expand *2. Protocol editor > Protocol* in the settings grid, set its name and epochs, then press **Save protocol**. It is saved on this PC (protocols folder) and on the Pi, and appears in the drop-down list.

**Sections of this workflow** (each starts with a note like this one)
- Pi connection: network settings, connection monitor, Pi buttons
- Camera: raw feed, grayscale + threshold, tracking, video recording
- Experiment: protocol list, start / stop, Pi messages log
- Protocol editor
- Log and window layout]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>Pi connection</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[**Pi connection**

*CreatePiConnection* holds the network settings of the Raspberry Pi (shown in the settings grid, category *3. Pi connection*). All other Pi nodes find it through its name ("Arena").

*MonitorPiConnection* asks the Pi for its status every second; the result is shown as a green / red panel in the window.

The three buttons show the panel test pattern, blank the ring, or restart buridan_server on the Pi over SSH (with the user name and password).]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Host" DisplayName="Pi host" Category="3. Pi connection" Description="Host name or IP address of the Raspberry Pi." />
        <Property Name="Username" DisplayName="Pi user name" Category="3. Pi connection" Description="User name for SSH login on the Pi (default: buridan)." />
        <Property Name="Password" DisplayName="Pi password" Category="3. Pi connection" Description="Password for SSH login on the Pi (default: buridan)." />
        <Property Name="HostKeyFingerprint" DisplayName="Pi host key (optional)" Category="3. Pi connection" Description="Optional SHA256 fingerprint of the Pi's SSH host key. When set, SSH refuses a machine with a different key." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:CreatePiConnection">
          <bur:Name>Arena</bur:Name>
          <bur:Host>raspberrypi.local</bur:Host>
          <bur:Username>buridan</bur:Username>
          <bur:Password>buridan</bur:Password>
          <bur:HostKeyFingerprint />
          <bur:CommandPort>5555</bur:CommandPort>
          <bur:FramePort>5556</bur:FramePort>
          <bur:StatusPort>5557</bur:StatusPort>
          <bur:ReplyTimeoutMilliseconds>2000</bur:ReplyTimeoutMilliseconds>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:MonitorPiConnection">
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
          <bur:Interval>PT1S</bur:Interval>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>TestPatternButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Show test pattern</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:SetPiMode">
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
          <bur:Mode>TestPattern</bur:Mode>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>BlankButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Blank ring</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:StopPi">
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>RestartButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Restart Pi server</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:RestartPiServer">
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
          <bur:ServiceName>buridan-server</bur:ServiceName>
          <bur:TimeoutSeconds>15</bur:TimeoutSeconds>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>Camera</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[**Camera**

*CameraCapture* reads the USB camera. Its frames are:
- shown as the raw feed,
- recorded into the current experiment session (*SessionVideoWriter*, only while an experiment runs),
- converted to grayscale and thresholded into a binary image (animal white, background black).

The threshold value is set with the slider in the window. If the animal appears black instead of white, change *Threshold type* in the settings grid (category *4. Camera*) between BinaryInv (dark animal on bright floor) and Binary (bright animal on dark floor).

The binary image is analysed (FindContours > BinaryRegionAnalysis > LargestBinaryRegion) and the largest white region (the animal) is written to tracking.csv.]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Index" DisplayName="Camera index" Category="4. Camera" Description="Index of the USB camera (0 = first camera)." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:CameraCapture">
          <cv:Index>0</cv:Index>
          <cv:CaptureProperties />
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:SessionVideoWriter">
          <bur:FrameRate>30</bur:FrameRate>
          <bur:FourCC>FMP4</bur:FourCC>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:Grayscale" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:SliderBuilder">
        <gui:Name>ThresholdSlider</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Minimum>0</gui:Minimum>
        <gui:Maximum>255</gui:Maximum>
        <gui:DecimalPlaces>0</gui:DecimalPlaces>
        <gui:Value>100</gui:Value>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
        <PropertyMappings>
          <Property Name="ThresholdValue" />
        </PropertyMappings>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="ThresholdType" DisplayName="Threshold type" Category="4. Camera" Description="BinaryInv: dark animal on a bright floor becomes white. Binary: bright animal on a dark floor becomes white." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:Threshold">
          <cv:ThresholdValue>100</cv:ThresholdValue>
          <cv:MaxValue>255</cv:MaxValue>
          <cv:ThresholdType>BinaryInv</cv:ThresholdType>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:FindContours">
          <cv:Mode>External</cv:Mode>
          <cv:Method>ChainApproxNone</cv:Method>
          <cv:Offset>
            <cv:X>0</cv:X>
            <cv:Y>0</cv:Y>
          </cv:Offset>
          <cv:MinArea>10</cv:MinArea>
          <cv:MaxArea xsi:nil="true" />
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:BinaryRegionAnalysis" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="cv:LargestBinaryRegion" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:SessionTrackingWriter" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>Experiment</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[**Experiment**

The drop-down list shows the protocol files in the protocols folder. It is filled when the workflow starts, after every protocol save, and when *Refresh protocol list* is pressed. The selected name is kept in the *SelectedProtocol* subject.

**Start experiment** passes the selected protocol name to *StartExperiment*, which:
1. creates a session folder in the data folder (settings grid, *1. Experiment*),
2. starts recording video, tracking and Pi messages,
3. sends the protocol to the Pi and starts it.

**Stop experiment** stops the Pi and closes the session. The session is also closed automatically when the Pi reports *protocol_end*.

*ReceivePiMessages* receives the status and events published by the Pi; *SessionPiMessageWriter* records them into pi_messages.csv.]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="DataFolder" DisplayName="Data folder" Category="1. Experiment" Description="Folder on this PC where experiment data is saved. A sub-folder is created for every run." />
        <Property Name="AnimalId" DisplayName="Animal ID" Category="1. Experiment" Description="Identifier of the animal, used in the session folder name." />
        <Property Name="Experimenter" DisplayName="Experimenter" Category="1. Experiment" Description="Name of the experimenter (saved in session.json)." />
        <Property Name="Notes" DisplayName="Notes" Category="1. Experiment" Description="Free-text notes about this run (saved in session.json)." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="ProtocolFolder" DisplayName="Protocol folder" Category="1. Experiment" Description="Folder on this PC containing the protocol files." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Timer">
          <rx:DueTime>PT0S</rx:DueTime>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>RefreshButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Refresh protocol list</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ListProtocolFiles">
          <bur:ProtocolFolder>protocols</bur:ProtocolFolder>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ComboBoxDataSourceBuilder">
        <gui:Name>ProtocolList</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:DisplayMember />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
        <Name>SelectedProtocol</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>StartButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Start experiment</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>SelectedProtocol</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:WithLatestFrom" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>Item2</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:StartExperiment">
          <bur:DataFolder>data</bur:DataFolder>
          <bur:AnimalId>fly01</bur:AnimalId>
          <bur:Experimenter />
          <bur:Notes />
          <bur:ProtocolFolder>protocols</bur:ProtocolFolder>
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>StopButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Stop experiment</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:StopExperiment">
          <bur:SendStopToPi>true</bur:SendStopToPi>
          <bur:Reason>stop button</bur:Reason>
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ReceivePiMessages">
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
          <bur:IncludeStatus>true</bur:IncludeStatus>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:SessionPiMessageWriter" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:FilterPiEvent">
          <bur:EventName>protocol_end</bur:EventName>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:StopExperiment">
          <bur:SendStopToPi>false</bur:SendStopToPi>
          <bur:Reason>protocol_end</bur:Reason>
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>Protocol editor</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[**Protocol editor**

The protocol being edited is the *Protocol* property of *SaveProtocol*, shown in the settings grid (category *2. Protocol editor*). Expand it to set the name, the frame rate and the list of epochs (click "..." next to *Epochs* to add, remove or edit epochs; each epoch has a stimulus type, a duration and the parameters of each stimulus type).

**Save protocol** checks the protocol, saves it as <name>.json in the protocols folder of this PC, and uploads it to the Pi. The result appears in the log, and the protocol list is refreshed.]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="Protocol" DisplayName="Protocol" Category="2. Protocol editor" Description="The protocol being edited. Expand it to set the name, frame rate and epochs." />
        <Property Name="UploadToPi" DisplayName="Also save on the Pi" Category="2. Protocol editor" Description="If true, saved protocols are also stored on the Raspberry Pi." />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:ButtonBuilder">
        <gui:Name>SaveProtocolButton</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:Text>Save protocol</gui:Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:SaveProtocol">
          <bur:ProtocolFolder>protocols</bur:ProtocolFolder>
          <bur:UploadToPi>true</bur:UploadToPi>
          <bur:Connection>Arena</bur:Connection>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="bur:ToText" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>Log and window layout</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[**Log and window layout**

Every result (experiment start/stop, protocol save, Pi commands, SSH restart) is turned into a line of text and merged into the log shown at the bottom right of the window.

The window is built from nested table layouts:
- *MainWindow*: left = SidePanel, right = RightPanel
- *SidePanel* (top to bottom): settings grid, protocol list, run buttons, protocol buttons, Pi buttons, threshold slider, Pi status
- *RightPanel*: VideoPanel (raw | binary camera images) above the log

Double-click *MainWindow* while the workflow runs to open the window.]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Merge" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:PropertyGridBuilder">
        <gui:Name>SettingsGrid</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:HelpVisible>true</gui:HelpVisible>
        <gui:ToolbarVisible>false</gui:ToolbarVisible>
        <gui:AutoRefresh>false</gui:AutoRefresh>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>RunButtons</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>2</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>1</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>ProtocolButtons</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>2</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>1</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>PiButtons</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>3</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>1</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>33.33</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>33.33</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>33.34</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>SidePanel</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>1</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>7</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>100</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>30</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>40</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>36</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>36</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>50</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>80</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>VideoPanel</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>2</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>1</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>50</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>RightPanel</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>1</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>2</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>100</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>75</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>25</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="VisualizerMapping" />
      <Expression xsi:type="gui:TableLayoutPanelBuilder">
        <gui:Name>MainWindow</gui:Name>
        <gui:Enabled>true</gui:Enabled>
        <gui:Visible>true</gui:Visible>
        <gui:ColumnCount>2</gui:ColumnCount>
        <gui:RowCount>1</gui:RowCount>
        <gui:ColumnStyles>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Absolute</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>460</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
          <gui:ColumnStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Width>100</gui:Width>
          </gui:ColumnStyle>
        </gui:ColumnStyles>
        <gui:RowStyles>
          <gui:RowStyle>
            <gui:SizeType>Percent</gui:SizeType>
            <gui:Height>100</gui:Height>
          </gui:RowStyle>
        </gui:RowStyles>
        <gui:CellSpans />
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="78" Label="Source7" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="7" To="76" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
